<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
affirmative vote of the holders of a majority of the shares represented at the Annual Meeting and entitled to vote was required for approval
of the Auditor Appointment Proposal. The proposal was approved.</span></p>

